  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 502.06 Initial plate",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 502.06 \"Initial plate\" means a requested registration plate composed entirely of letters or a combination of letters, numbers and symbols, for an additional fee, the proceeds of which are deposited in accordance with RSA 263:52. The term includes “vanity plate”.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500)",
